{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52019","headline":"寻苗道士山居 · 王绩","name":"寻苗道士山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抱琴欲隐去，杖策访幽潜。\n青溪无限曲，丹障几重帘。\n水声全绕砌，树影半横檐。\n甑尘炊暂拂，鑪香尽更添。\n短茅新缚荐，细藋始编檐。\n写咒桃爲板，题经竹作签。\n紫文千岁蝠，丹书五月蟾。\n三山今近远，飞路幸相兼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}